---
// ABOUTME: The closing two-card CTA: cloud start versus self-host, on the paper band.
// ABOUTME: "Free while you're small" is the Free-plan promise from PRD §7; keep them in step.
---

<section class="border-ink/7 border-t bg-paper">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6 py-22 lg:px-10">
		<div class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-[640px] text-center">
			<h2
				class="m-0 font-semibold text-[clamp(32px,4vw,46px)] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.025em]"
			>
				Ready to ship licensing?
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-4 mb-0 text-[18px] text-smoke leading-[1.55]">
				Free while you're small. No card to start. Pick the path that fits how you like to run
				things.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[900px] gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
			<div class="rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-7">
				<div class="mb-4 inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] bg-lime">
					<svg
						width="20"
						height="20"
						viewBox="0 0 24 24"
						fill="none"
						stroke="#1a1a19"
						stroke-width="1.9"
						stroke-linecap="round"
						stroke-linejoin="round"
						aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 2L3 14h7l-1 8 10-12h-7z"></path></svg
					>
				</div>
				<h3 class="mt-0 mb-1.5 font-semibold text-[20px]">Start on the cloud</h3>
				<p class="mt-0 mb-5 text-[15px] text-smoke leading-normal">
					Create a product, connect Stripe, and issue your first key in ten minutes. We run it
					for you.
				</p>
				<a
					href="https://app.coolbeans.tools"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-[7px] rounded-[10px] border border-lime-deep bg-lime px-4.5 py-[11px] font-semibold text-[15px] text-ink hover:bg-lime-hover"
					>Start free<svg
						width="15"
						height="15"
						viewBox="0 0 24 24"
						fill="none"
						stroke="currentColor"
						stroke-width="2.4"
						stroke-linecap="round"
						aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg
					></a
				>
			</div>
			<div id="selfhost" class="rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-7">
				<div class="mb-4 inline-flex size-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[10px] bg-ink">
					<svg
						width="20"
						height="20"
						viewBox="0 0 24 24"
						fill="none"
						stroke="#c8ff4d"
						stroke-width="1.9"
						aria-hidden="true"
						><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect
							x="3"
							y="13"
							width="18"
							height="7"
							rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 7.5h.01M7 16.5h.01"></path></svg
					>
				</div>
				<h3 class="mt-0 mb-1.5 font-semibold text-[20px]">Self-host it</h3>
				<p class="mt-0 mb-5 text-[15px] text-smoke leading-normal">
					One compose file and a Postgres URL. Your keys and customer data never leave your
					infrastructure.
				</p>
				<a
					href="/docs/self-hosting"
					class="inline-flex items-center gap-[7px] rounded-[10px] border border-ink/18 bg-white px-4.5 py-[11px] font-semibold text-[15px] text-ink hover:border-ink/36"
					>Read the guide<svg
						width="15"
						height="15"
						viewBox="0 0 24 24"
						fill="none"
						stroke="currentColor"
						stroke-width="2.4"
						stroke-linecap="round"
						aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg
					></a
				>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
